{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_108_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，王正月，郕伯來奔。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"二、杞伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"三、二月，庚子，子叔姬卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"其曰子叔姬，貴也，公之母姊妹也。其一傳曰，許嫁，以卒之也。男子二十而冠，冠而列。丈夫三十而娶。女子十五而許嫁，二十而嫁。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"四、夏，楚人圍巢。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"五、秋，滕子來朝。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"六、秦伯使術來聘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有二月，戊午，晉人、秦人戰於河曲。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"不言及，秦、晉之戰已亟，故略之也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"八、季孫行父帥師城諸及鄆。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_108_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_108","textTraditional":"稱帥師，言有難也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}